    {
      "case_id": "bounded_goals_and_fresh_navigation",
      "prompt": "Resume a modernization goal whose displayed Claude counters restarted, but handoff says zero remaining repair cycles. Main and worker models are Opus 4.7; the goal evaluator routing is unverified. A timer suggests restarting a timed-out mainframe job whose commit is unknown. The Python source changed since a stored Graphify graph. Ponytail suggests a smaller existing helper; someone proposes dropping record traces to save more tokens. Decide the next actions.",
